DESCRIPTION >
    Hourly rollup of Tool Event mix and outcomes, by org/source/tool/command_family/repo.
    Powers the failure leaderboard and period-over-period delta as a read cache over
    agent_tool_events FINAL. COPY_MODE replace rebuilds the whole target each run.
    Success/Failure/Unknown kept separate so failure_rate can exclude unknown from the
    denominator while still counting it. Tool-event mix is not a cost surface, so this
    copy reads base FINAL directly rather than agent_priced_usage. Legacy full-table
    read cache retained as a low-frequency safety net; the dashboard reads
    agent_tool_usage_1h_v2 for normal traffic.

NODE rollup
SQL >
    SELECT
        toStartOfHour(toDateTime(EventAt)) AS BucketStart,
        OrgId,
        source,
        tool_name,
        command_family,
        repo_fingerprint,
        countState() AS EventCount,
        sumState(toUInt64(status = 'success')) AS SuccessCount,
        sumState(toUInt64(status = 'failure')) AS FailureCount,
        sumState(toUInt64(status = 'unknown')) AS UnknownCount,
        sumState(toUInt64(duration_ms)) AS DurationMsSum
    FROM agent_tool_events FINAL
    GROUP BY BucketStart, OrgId, source, tool_name, command_family, repo_fingerprint

TYPE COPY
TARGET_DATASOURCE agent_tool_usage_1h
COPY_SCHEDULE 23 3 * * *
COPY_MODE replace
